<section class="ziyu-hero">
  <div class="ziyu-container ziyu-grid-12">
    <div class="ziyu-hero__copy">
      <span class="ziyu-label">Chapter 01 · In Development</span>

      <h1 class="ziyu-display">Goal Grower</h1>

      <p class="ziyu-body-lg">
        A botanical goal-tracking system where habits, projects, and long-term growth become a living garden.
      </p>

      <div class="ziyu-hero__actions">
        <a href="/pages/support" class="ziyu-button">Join Waitlist</a>
        <a href="/pages/roadmap" class="ziyu-button ziyu-button--ghost">View Roadmap</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ziyu-hero__visual">
      <div class="ziyu-card" style="aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;">
        <img class="ziyu-image" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1466692476868-aef1dfb1e735?q=80&w=1400&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Goal Grower">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ziyu-section ziyu-section--soft">
  <div class="ziyu-container ziyu-grid-12">
    <div style="grid-column: span 5;">
      <span class="ziyu-label">Origin Story</span>
      <h2 class="ziyu-h2">Productivity apps often make growth feel like pressure.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="ziyu-text-stack" style="grid-column: span 7;">
      <p class="ziyu-body-lg">Goal Grower starts from a different metaphor. Instead of streak pressure and gamified urgency, it treats goals like living systems that need attention, patience, and care.</p>
      <p class="ziyu-body-lg">The goal is to help users build a life slowly and sustainably: one habit, one project, one intentional action at a time.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ziyu-section">
  <div class="ziyu-container">
    <span class="ziyu-label">Experience</span>
    <h2 class="ziyu-h2" style="max-width: 760px; margin-bottom: 80px;">Features designed as emotional systems.</h2>

    <div class="ziyu-grid-3">
      <div class="ziyu-card" style="padding: 40px;">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 48px; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 32px;">potted_plant</span>
        <h3 class="ziyu-h4">Botanical Progress</h3>
        <p class="ziyu-body" style="margin-top: 16px;">Goals grow visually over time, turning consistency into something recognizable and meaningful.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ziyu-card" style="padding: 40px;">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 48px; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 32px;">public</span>
        <h3 class="ziyu-h4">Realms of Life</h3>
        <p class="ziyu-body" style="margin-top: 16px;">Organize growth by learning, health, spirituality, creativity, work, and relationships.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ziyu-card" style="padding: 40px;">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 48px; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 32px;">timeline</span>
        <h3 class="ziyu-h4">Long-Term Growth</h3>
        <p class="ziyu-body" style="margin-top: 16px;">Built for sustainable improvement instead of short bursts of motivation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ziyu-section ziyu-section--dark">
  <div class="ziyu-manifesto">
    <span class="ziyu-label" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,.7);">Join the Build</span>
    <h2 class="ziyu-h2">Help shape the first version.</h2>
    <p style="margin-top: 24px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.78);">Early supporters help guide Goal Grower through feedback, testing, and field notes.</p>
    <a href="/pages/support" class="ziyu-button ziyu-button--light" style="margin-top: 36px;">Join Waitlist</a>
  </div>
</section>

